    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "89eeaa63-7560-3dfe-80a7-f4cc55f5936a",
                "word": "cahoots",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4f2e25f1-d887-43cb-9ee9-8801f51a1869",
                        "entry_id": "89eeaa63-7560-3dfe-80a7-f4cc55f5936a",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "cahoot"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                        "entry_id": "89eeaa63-7560-3dfe-80a7-f4cc55f5936a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Chiefly preceded by in: collaboration or collusion, chiefly for a nefarious reason."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "plural-normally"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f56182b-6a3d-421d-bae4-17cec66fea98",
                                "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                                "text": "Those two are definitely in cahoots."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eeeff69a-3855-406b-9b7d-52bac7b22787",
                                "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                                "text": "There was no stage on the road, and no vehicle in the place except these mighty wagons. Accordingly I struck a bargain with a wagoner, who took my baggage. 'You may go with me,' said he, 'but may-be you can't go cahoots with me in my eatin' fixin's, stranger.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "671d2583-1e8a-47c4-a66e-bf56699a491b",
                                "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                                "text": "Like as not, Uncle Billy is still in ‘cahoots’ [i.e., shares] with his old pard, and is just laughin’ at us as he’s sendin’ him accounts of our tomfoolin’."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0734b522-682d-4964-8bf3-77f5fa8b1179",
                                "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                                "text": "[…] I suspected him of being in cahoots with the steward, who got the lights doused long enough for the pearls to be stolen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36fab64c-2f89-4a8a-86b2-2ed5694e080b",
                                "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                                "text": "Now it came to pass that the President of the Republic of Guaduragua was suspected of being in cahoots with a Juju society, of consulting astrologers, and of being under the undue influence of a designing woman; whereupon the Guaduraguan Parliament thought it well to investigate the matter, and came together on its own initiative for that purpose. […] [I]t was not in Guaduragua at all that the comedy was enacted, but in one of the Sovereign Commonwealths of the United States of America."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a63b5eb2-f399-474d-abdc-6a3f06714fb8",
                                "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                                "text": "They probably give it back to him; they're all in cahoots."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dce55f77-03d9-4fd1-a5d7-01706022b861",
                                "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                                "text": "The Klan was in cahoots with political, business, and law-enforcement leaders."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5033bbc6-589d-4b80-af61-cde1fcf14432",
                                "sense_id": "43e49acb-eb94-3bde-ad35-532296204bfa",
                                "text": "[A] sense of grievance and victimization has come to permeate the modern conservative identity. […] In this account, Hollywood acts in functional cahoots with academia and the news media, and what drives the populism of Republican politicians like Ron DeSantis in Florida and J[ames] D[avid] Vance in Ohio is full-throated opposition to those institutions."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "83c3b433-3b9c-3d28-be9e-89de65821b5c",
                        "entry_id": "89eeaa63-7560-3dfe-80a7-f4cc55f5936a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "plural of cahoot (“a company or partnership; a group of people working together, chiefly for a nefarious reason, hence, a collaboration or collusion; an accomplice, partner”)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "form-of",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-normally",
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c16e2b96-c4e4-49af-8df5-4d5c32c2e495",
                        "source_entry_id": "89eeaa63-7560-3dfe-80a7-f4cc55f5936a",
                        "source_sense_description": "collaboration or collusion, chiefly for a nefarious reason — see also collaboration, collusion",
                        "target_lang_word": "ligue",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ligue",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9342585b-9d7b-3e3f-ba29-3f2277a7002c",
                                        "entry_id": "b9212d94-6a21-30f8-bfa2-df752fdc0060",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Confédération de plusieurs États, pour se défendre ou pour attaquer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1deb8e4-6061-4199-8bf6-346e4a198112",
                                                "sense_id": "9342585b-9d7b-3e3f-ba29-3f2277a7002c",
                                                "text": "Toutefois, les cités islamiques n'avaient jamais créé d'institutions autonomes, pas plus qu'elles n'avaient pris de mesures de défense comparables à celles des ligues lombardes ou hanséatiques."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a57efcf6-41b0-4cdc-a3ca-ebbe95383145",
                                                "sense_id": "9342585b-9d7b-3e3f-ba29-3f2277a7002c",
                                                "text": "La confédération béotienne, à l'inverse des ligues péloponnésiennes ou athéniennes, ne semble pas avoir d'abord été une symmachie, mais bien plutôt se rattacher à ces Koina qui rassemblaient autour d'un sanctuaire les cités d'un même ethnos."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74050fc7-7ba0-3663-89f1-391af52ab0e9",
                                        "entry_id": "b9212d94-6a21-30f8-bfa2-df752fdc0060",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Union qui s’était formée en France, vers la fin du seizième siècle, pour défendre la religion catholique contre les huguenots."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Absolument",
                                            "France"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2dcbd49-a6d2-422e-b348-178ce0c79c73",
                                                "sense_id": "74050fc7-7ba0-3663-89f1-391af52ab0e9",
                                                "text": "Les terribles prêcheurs de Seize, les moines qui portaient le mousquet aux processions de la Ligue, s'humanisent tout à coup ; les voilà devenus bénins. C'est qu'il faut bien essayer d’endormir ceux qu'on n'a pas pu tuer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e845b42e-ed94-3b26-8c24-1957f37f9f43",
                                        "entry_id": "b9212d94-6a21-30f8-bfa2-df752fdc0060",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Complot, cabale que plusieurs particuliers font ensemble pour réussir dans quelque projet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0a23c4f-974c-4cf2-9dae-65373fffc6f7",
                                                "sense_id": "e845b42e-ed94-3b26-8c24-1957f37f9f43",
                                                "text": "La ligue de la nation contre les jésuites ressemble à la ligue de Cambra contre la république de Venise, qui avait pour principale cause les richesses et l’insolence de ces républicains."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27572294-0ea9-4e23-a062-3d45b31bd13f",
                                                "sense_id": "e845b42e-ed94-3b26-8c24-1957f37f9f43",
                                                "text": "Le templier perd, comme tu l’as dit, ses droits sociaux, son libre arbitre ; mais il fait partie et devient membre d’un corps puissant devant lequel les trônes commencent déjà à trembler. Comme la goutte de pluie qui se mêle à la mer devient une portion de cet océan irrésistible qui mine les rochers et engloutit des flottes, cette ligue formidable est aussi une mer immense."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45431a5c-37b6-412b-bc1f-1b09bb1d157b",
                                                "sense_id": "e845b42e-ed94-3b26-8c24-1957f37f9f43",
                                                "text": "— Fi donc ! fi donc ! monseigneur, des gens d’honneur comme nous ! une conjuration ! ah ! du tout ! une ligue, tout au plus, un petit accord pour donner la direction au vœu unanime de la nation et de la cour : voilà tout !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f43f8f67-4e71-3b84-bd18-4d8b6e6dac9b",
                                        "entry_id": "b9212d94-6a21-30f8-bfa2-df752fdc0060",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Association à but social ou humanitaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "107eb5ab-9b84-43e2-bc8d-c40d969270ea",
                                                "sense_id": "f43f8f67-4e71-3b84-bd18-4d8b6e6dac9b",
                                                "text": "Alors comment redonner aux bourgeois français le goût de la famille et des progénitures copieuses ? Des ligues pour la repopulation ? Bah ! Elles sont composées, en majeure partie, de célibataires endurcis […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
